NOTICE — third-party assets

This project bundles character sprites derived from the ChatDev visualisation
shipped by OpenBMB. ChatDev (https://github.com/OpenBMB/ChatDev) is
distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The sprite art itself is
reproduced here under the same terms; no modifications other than cropping
to per-character bounding boxes, scaling, quantising, and re-packing into a
single sprite sheet are made.

Files:
  app/assets/chatdev_src/   — original 144 PNGs, downloaded by
                              scripts/fetch_chatdev_sprites.py from
                              https://github.com/OpenBMB/ChatDev/tree/main/
                              frontend/public/sprites
  app/assets/chatdev_sheet.png   — composite sheet used at runtime
  app/assets/chatdev_sheet.js    — same sheet as base64, inlined into
                                   bazaar_live.html

